{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 2, :comments ["<b>If they dig through to Sheol:</b> downward, and it is written: ערום שאול נגדו (Sheol is naked before Him)." "<b>At the head of Carmel:</b> its forest and its orchard. And if on the sea floor they dwell, [there is] נחש, and it is a great fish resembling a snake, and it is written: נחש בריח, נחש עקלתון."], :book :amos, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 9, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Amos -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/amos"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:18:39.116955550Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}